# Conformance probe pack for groups (spec 0.7) on the `xml` wire. Public. No
# kinds. Items under a path (`body/item`) with attributes, a child element's
# text, a `const`, a `default` and a nested list whose items carry `#text`;
# a list of text items that are children of the root; and a list of text items
# under a path. The elements `head` and `tail` sit before and after `body`.
# An item's own text is written "#text" in quotes: a bare `#` at the start of a
# token starts a comment (ruling 1 of 0.1.1, ruling 17 of 0.5).
format  conformance-groups-xml
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    xml
root    msg
field   uid       @id        string
field   callsign  head/@cs   string
group   probe.items  body/item
  field   probe.label  @name      string
  field   probe.qty    qty/#text  int
  field   probe.ratio  @r         float
  const   @k  i
  default probe.qty  1
  group   probe.subs  sub
    field  probe.tag  "#text"  string
    field  probe.val  @v     int
  end
end
field   how       tail/@how  string
group   probe.names  name
  field  probe.tag  "#text"  string
end
group   probe.nums  nums/n
  field  probe.val  "#text"  int
end
